# SacBeforeETB: "instead sacrifice each other permanent named Sheltered
# Valley you control, then put it onto the battlefield." SacrificeAll runs
# before the new Valley is on the battlefield, so only the old one goes. The
# old Valley's upkeep trigger (three or fewer lands: gain 1 life) resolves
# first, since a land cannot be played with it on the stack.
startturn human
advance 3
resolvestack
playland human 1
